,"type":"text"},{"text":"also named “RGAA”.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"The WCAG specifications, for AA level, defines a contrast ratio of 4.5:1 for textual elements (i.e. texts), and 3:1 for non-textual elements (i.e. link’s chevron).","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"However it is higly recommended for mobile devices to reach AAA level because of the screen sizes and luminosity issues, i.e. 7:1 for textual"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"and 4.5:1 for non-textual elements.","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"This utility helps to define wether a set of contrast ratio matches AA and AAA or not."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"See for example "},{"identifier":"https:\/\/system.design.orange.com\/0c1af118d\/p\/2531b9-accessibility-compliance","type":"reference","isActive":true}],"url":"\/documentation\/oudsfoundations\/oudswcag21ratio","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"OUDSWCAG21Ratio","kind":"identifier"}],"kind":"symbol","type":"topic","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"text":"OUDSWCAG21Ratio","kind":"identifier"}]},"doc://OUDSFoundations/documentation/OUDSFoundations/OUDSWCAG21Ratio/luminance(for:)":{"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/oudsfoundations\/oudswcag21ratio\/luminance(for:)","title":"luminance(for:)","role":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Returns the luminance of the given color using the WCAG 2.1 algorithm."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"See https:\/\/www.w3.org\/WAI\/WCAG21\/Techniques\/general\/G18.html#procedure"}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSFoundations\/documentation\/OUDSFoundations\/OUDSWCAG21Ratio\/luminance(for:)","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"static"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"luminance"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"for"}